# Everything the image build does not need, and one thing it must not have.
#
# `target/` is the important entry: it is gigabytes, and without this line
# every build sends all of it to the daemon before running a single
# instruction. The rest is noise that would invalidate layer caching on
# changes that cannot affect a binary.

target/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
coverage/

.git/
.github/
.claude/

docs/
examples/
*.md

.gitignore
.dockerignore
deny.toml
clippy.toml
